  "statement": "A balanced parenthesis string is defined as follows: - The empty string is balanced. - If `P` is balanced, `(P)` is also balanced. - If `P` and `Q` are balanced, `PQ` is also balanced. `\"()\"`, `\"(())()\"` are examples of balanced parenthesis strings while `\"(()\"`, `\"())\"` are not balanced.",
